  text "RIVER. The water flows to the right (Current 2.5 m/s). Ripples and foam travel downstream and the crates drift with it. Foam gathers where the water is shallow near the banks and the rocks." 1 1 1 1 2 1 12 12 9 0 0 0 0 0.78431374 1 1 0 1 0 0 0 0.9019608 0 420 120 0 0 0 0 0 0.54901963 0 0 0 1 0 0 0.47058824 0.627451 1 1 -1 0 0 "" 0 0.02 4
